{
  "description": "ADR-0039 offer up a shift (docs/18 §4). The contract between SHIFT_OFFER_TRANSITIONS / SHIFT_OFFER_MODE_TRANSITIONS in state.ts, canOfferShift / offerExpiresAt / takeOffer / offerVisibleTo in shiftOffer.ts, and shift_offer_transitions(), shift_offer_mode_transitions() and the shift_offers_state_guard trigger in 20260930100100_staff_additions_schema.sql (take_offered_shift() in 20260930110100 is held to the take cases). Every pair of distinct statuses NOT listed under edges is illegal; staying in the same status is not a transition. In take and visibility inputs, candidate=false means the worker has no auto_assign_candidates row at all (gate undefined); wave1Exhausted means every wave-1 candidate has been pushed the offer, and autoAssign=false (the event or role switch off) makes wave 1 count as exhausted at once (offerWave1Exhausted(); offer_wave1_exhausted() since 20260930150000). visibility.bookingStatus is the viewer's own booking on the section (null = none). Regenerate the pgTAP half with: node packages/domain/scripts/gen-vectors-sql.mjs",
